---
import { routeEnglish } from "@ts-config-path/lib/menu";
import { LINKS_TO } from "@styles/utilsCSS";
import HeroTopProjects from "./img-components/Hero-Top-Projects.astro";
---

<section class="break-normal hyphens-auto">
  <p class="mb-4">
    I build creative systems to explore math, computation and music through
    analogies. I think aloud, sketching arrows and questions by hand. My{" "}
    <a href="/blog/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={LINKS_TO}>
      notes
    </a>{" "}
    are a percolation of these ideas.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Among my libraries are{" "}
    <a
      href="https://rubygems.org/gems/modular_forms"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class={LINKS_TO}
    >
      modular_forms
    </a>{" "}
    (inspired by SageMath and LMFDB),{" "}
    <a id="projects" href={routeEnglish.projects} rel="noopener" class={LINKS_TO}>
      multidimensional figurate numbers
    </a>{" "}
    with over <strong> 30,000 downloads</strong>, and{" "}
    <a
      href="https://topos.live/#ziffers_tonnetz"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class={LINKS_TO}
    >
      {" "}
      ts-tonnetz
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <div class="my-8">
    <HeroTopProjects />
  </div>
  <p class="mb-4">
    I have served as a{" "}
    <a
      id="cy-effective-orcid-url"
      class={LINKS_TO}
      href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9672-9087"
      target="orcid.widget"
      rel="me noopener noreferrer"
      style="vertical-align: top"
    >
      peer reviewer
    </a>{" "}
    for <em>The European Physical Journal Special Topics</em>, published a{" "}
    <a
      href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-07015-0_30"
      target="_blank"
      class={LINKS_TO}
      rel="noopener"
    >
      Scopus-indexed article
    </a>{" "}
    on Mathematical Music Theory, contribute to{" "}
    <a
      href="https://oeis.org/A402225"
      target="_blank"
      class={LINKS_TO}
      rel="noopener"
    >
      OEIS
    </a>{" "}
    and open-source projects, and teach postgraduate courses.
  </p>
</section>
